\[
\text{ZnO} + \text{C} \rightarrow \text{Zn} + \text{CO}
\]  
(d) **Fe₂O₃ (Iron(III) oxide):** Iron is more reactive than carbon, so it can be reduced by carbon in the blast furnace process.  
