3. 11 AM: 118 - 2 = 116
4. 12 PM: 116 - 2 = 114
5. 1 PM: 114 - 2 = 112
6. 2 PM: 112 - 2 = 110
7. 3 PM: 110 - 2 = 108
8. 4 PM: 108 - 2 = 106
9. 5 PM: 106 - 2 = 104

The total number of vertices is the sum of the numbers in the arithmetic sequence:
\[
120 + 118 + 116 + 114 + 112 + 110 + 108 + 106 + 104 = \sum_{i=1}^{9} (120 - 2(i - 1)) = \sum_{i=1}^{9} (120 - 2i + 2) = \sum_{i=1}^{9} (122 - 2i)
\]
The sum of an arithmetic sequence is:
\[
S = \frac{n}{2} \times (a_1 + a_n)
\]
