\[
\nabla_\beta V^\mu = \frac{\partial V^\mu}{\partial x^\beta} + \Gamma_\nu^\mu \nu V^\nu
\]

where:
- \( V^\mu \) is the four-vector (e.g., velocity, momentum, and other physical quantities).
- \( \nabla_\beta \) is the cofactor derivative with respect to the coordinate \( x^\beta \).
